The Level 0 book, which has parts a bit dated, is a traditional textbook
mode resource. Including a good walk-through of the grammar basics.

http://www.*lojban*.org/publications/*level0*/*lojbanLevel0*.pdf
http://www.lojban.org/static/publications/level0.html

Then there is the CLL (Complete Lojban language) 0.99:
http://www.lojban.org/static/publications/reference_grammar.html

It's has both errat from when published, as well as recent changes not
reflected within.

